---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { evidenceTiers } from '../../data/evidence-platform.mjs';
---
<BaseLayout title="Evidence and data publication policy" description="Evidence tiers, consent, privacy, provenance, versioning, cohort suppression, corrections, and public/private boundaries.">
  <div class="shell"><section class="hero reading"><p class="eyebrow">Evidence data policy</p><h1>Private work stays private. Public claims carry provenance.</h1><p class="lede">The platform separates local project data, protected review records, sanitized submissions, and approved public evidence.</p></section>
  <section class="evidence-tier-grid">{evidenceTiers.map((tier) => <article><span class={`tier-marker ${tier.id}`}></span><h2>{tier.label}</h2><p>{tier.description}</p></article>)}</section>
  <section class="split-section section-space"><div><h2>Never public by default</h2><ul><li>Raw prompts or artifacts</li><li>Organization, employer, student, customer, medical, or financial records</li><li>Credentials, secrets, or model API keys</li><li>Private reviewer notes</li><li>Petition strategy or attorney work product</li></ul></div><div><h2>Required for a public record</h2><ul><li>Bounded factual claim</li><li>Issuer, date, method version, and source</li><li>Evidence tier and limitations</li><li>Consent and privacy decision</li><li>Review state, version hash, and correction path</li></ul></div></section>
  <section class="reading section-space"><h2>Public/private boundary</h2><p>The live static site contains only approved public records and empty-state registries. Counsel mapping and confidential evidence packages are generated locally and are not deployed. Optional account sync and editorial administration remain inactive until authenticated infrastructure, row-level-security tests, retention rules, and human approval are complete.</p><h2>Benchmark suppression</h2><p>A cohort needs at least 10 reviewed reports from at least three independent organizations. It is suppressed when one organization supplies more than half the cohort or when direct or indirect identification remains plausible.</p><h2>Downloads</h2><ul><li><a href="/schemas/workflow-evidence-record.schema.json">Workflow evidence record schema</a></li><li><a href="/schemas/public-evidence-record.schema.json">Public evidence record schema</a></li><li><a href="/schemas/counsel-evidence-record.schema.json">Local counsel evidence record schema</a></li></ul></section></div>
</BaseLayout>
